INSERT INTO `ai_chat_messages` VALUES (1,1,'user','Good evening, sakit ng likod ko',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-13 18:43:59','2026-09-13 18:43:59'),(2,1,'assistant','Good evening po! Naku, mukhang pagod na pagod po kayo sa shift niyo ngayon. While I understand na masakit ang likod niyo dahil siguro sa kabibilang ng inventory o katatayo sa ward, bilang HIMS AI Assistant ay nakatutok po ako sa supply chain at inventory management ng hospital.\n\nKung may kailangan po kayong suriin tungkol sa ating mga stock, tulad ng ating mga low stock items gaya ng **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** na may **18 units** na lang o ang **Ceftriaxone 1 g Vial** na may **12 units** na lang, sabihin niyo lang po at handa ko kayong tulungan. \n\nMagpahinga po muna kayo sandali o mag-unat kung maaari para guminhawa ang inyong likod! Paano ko kayo matutulungan sa HIMS ngayong gabi?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-13 18:43:59','2026-09-13 18:43:59'),(30001,1,'user','1+1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-14 07:29:41','2026-09-14 07:29:41'),(30002,1,'assistant','That equals **2**, just like combining two boxes of **Paracetamol 500mg Tablets** to bolster our current stock of **180 units**. \n\nIs there a specific calculation or inventory metric you would like me to work out for you right now, such as determining safety stock levels or reorder quantities?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-14 07:29:41','2026-09-14 07:29:41'),(60001,1,'user','TAMA BA YUNG FORECAST?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-14 13:18:22','2026-09-14 13:18:22'),(60002,1,'assistant','Para masuri natin kung tama ang forecast, tingnan natin ang data ng ating AI demand projection laban sa ating **Current Stock** at historical consumption. \n\nSa kasalukuyan nating tala as of Sep 14, 2026, ang ating mga high-risk items gaya ng **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** ay may **16 units** na lamang habang ang predicted demand nito ay aabot sa **280 units**, kaya ito ay may **high** risk level at nakatakdang maubusan ng stock (**out_of_stock**).\n\nBatay ito sa kanilang **increasing** demand trend at historical consumption na unti-unting tumaas nitong mga nakaraang linggo (halimbawa, mula sa 12 units noong Hunyo hanggang umabot sa 54-96 units kada linggo noong Setyembre). Ang confidence level ng ating AI model para sa mga ito ay **high** dahil malinaw na sinasalamin ng historical series ang bilis ng pagkaubos ng ating mga suplay.\n\nGayunpaman, para sa mga item na may **limited_data** tulad ng **Intropin (Dopamine HCl 40 mg/mL)** na may zero consumption history at **0 units** na stock, ang confidence ng forecast ay **low** at nangangailangan ng manual validation mula sa inyong team.\n\nMay partikular po ba kayong item forecast na nais nating suriin nang mas malalim, o gusto nating repasuhin ang recommended reorder quantities?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Checking demand forecast...','2026-09-14 13:18:22','2026-09-14 13:18:22'),(60003,1,'user','english please',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-14 13:18:49','2026-09-14 13:18:49'),(60004,1,'assistant','Certainly! Let us take a closer look at the accuracy and reliability of our AI demand forecasts based on the current inventory data as of Sep 14, 2026.\n\nOur forecasting model relies heavily on historical consumption patterns, demand trends, and lead times. For high-risk items like the **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** (SKU: FCAST-MASK-3PLY), the forecast projects a predicted demand of **280 units** against a critically low current stock of **16 units**. The historical series clearly shows an upward trajectory, jumping from 12 units per week in June up to nearly 96 units in early September. Because of this consistent, accelerating consumption pattern, the AI assigns a **high** confidence level to the projection, warning of a potential **out_of_stock** status.\n\nSimilarly, items like **Ceftriaxone 1 g Vial** and **IV Cannula 22G** show strong increasing demand trends supported by robust historical data, making their high-risk forecasts reliable indicators for urgent replenishment.\n\nOn the other hand, items with limited historical data require caution. For instance, **Intropin (Dopamine HCl 40 mg/mL)** currently has **0 units** of stock and zero recorded historical consumption, resulting in a **low** confidence forecast and an insufficient demand trend. For these items, the AI model cannot reliably project future usage, so manual assessment by the pharmacy or inventory team is necessary.\n\nWould you like me to review the forecast data or recommended reorder quantities for any other specific item in the system?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-14 13:18:49','2026-09-14 13:18:49'),(90001,1,'user','anong name mo?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-15 20:35:03','2026-09-15 20:35:03'),(90002,1,'assistant','Ako ang opisyal na HIMS AI Assistant, ang iyong kasama at copilot sa supply chain at inventory management dito sa Hospital Inventory Management System. \n\nAndito ako para tumulong sa pag-monitor ng ating mga stock levels, pagsusuri ng consumption patterns, pag-track ng mga expiring batches, at pagbibigay ng mga rekomendasyon base sa ating mga AI demand forecasts. \n\nMay maitutulong ba ako sa pag-check ng ating mga imbentaryo ngayon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-15 20:35:03','2026-09-15 20:35:03'),(90003,1,'user','goodnight',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-15 20:35:13','2026-09-15 20:35:13'),(90004,1,'assistant','Goodnight! Rest well knowing our inventory data is safely monitored. Feel free to reach out anytime tomorrow if you need help reviewing stock levels, checking expiring batches, or analyzing demand forecasts. Have a great rest!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-15 20:35:13','2026-09-15 20:35:13'),(120001,1,'user','sino ang pumatay kay Jose Rizal?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-16 18:05:49','2026-09-16 18:05:49'),(120002,1,'assistant','Si **Jose Rizal** ay binaril noong **December 30, 1896** sa **Bagumbayan** (ngayon ay Luneta Park) sa utos ng **Spanish colonial government**. \n\nAng mismong nagpakawala ng putok ay isang firing squad ng mga Pilipinong sundalo sa hukbong Espanyol, habang nasa likod naman nila ang mga Espanyol na sundalo na nakahandang mamaril kung sakaling tumanggi ang mga Pilipino.\n\nKung may iba ka pang katanungan o kung kailangan mo ng tulong sa pag-review ng ating hospital inventory at stock levels, sabihan mo lang ako.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-16 18:05:49','2026-09-16 18:05:49'),(150001,30001,'user','Which items are low in stock?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-17 01:48:56','2026-09-17 01:48:56'),(150002,30001,'assistant','**Sterile Syringe 5 mL — Warehouse Workflow Demo** (SKU: SWS-DEMO-SYRINGE-5ML)\n- **Current Stock**: 60 box\n- **Reorder Level**: 20 box\n- **Safety Stock**: 0 box\n- **Supplier Lead Time**: 7 days\n\n**Status:** Stock level is balanced and above reorder threshold.\n\n**Recent Stock Movements:**\n- transfer: 24 units on 2026-09-17\n- stock_in: 60 units on 2026-09-14\n\n*(Verified HIMS inventory record)*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Checking low-stock items...','2026-09-17 01:48:56','2026-09-17 01:48:56'),(150003,30002,'user','Explain the demand forecast',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-17 01:49:13','2026-09-17 01:49:13'),(150004,30002,'assistant','The HIMS demand forecast identifies **6 items at elevated stockout risk** over the upcoming 30-day period:\n1. **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** — Current Stock: 16 units | Predicted Demand: 268 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (16) is at or below the forecast reorder point (84).\n2. **Ceftriaxone 1 g Vial** — Current Stock: 10 units | Predicted Demand: 150 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (10) is at or below the forecast reorder point (48).\n3. **IV Cannula 22G** — Current Stock: 12 units | Predicted Demand: 209 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (12) is at or below the forecast reorder point (66).\n4. **Absorbable Suture 3-0** — Current Stock: 9 units | Predicted Demand: 119 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (9) is at or below the forecast reorder point (38).\n5. **Isopropyl Alcohol 70% 500 mL** — Current Stock: 7 units | Predicted Demand: 46 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (7) is at or below the forecast reorder point (18).\n6. **Disposable Syringe 5 mL** — Current Stock: 21 units | Predicted Demand: 106 units | Risk: **High**\n   *Reason:* On hand (21) is at or below the forecast reorder point (38).\n\nVisit the [Demand Forecast](/inventory/demand-forecast) page to adjust forecast parameters or download full clinical consumption reports.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Reviewing the demand forecast...','2026-09-17 01:49:13','2026-09-17 01:49:13'),(180001,60001,'user','Summarize inventory status',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-17 01:57:10','2026-09-17 01:57:10'),(180002,60001,'assistant','### HIMS Inventory Summary (Sep 17, 2026)\n\n- **Total Active Inventory SKUs:** 27\n- **Items Out of Stock:** 1\n- **Items Below Reorder Level:** 10\n- **Items at High Forecast Demand Risk:** 8\n- **Batches Expiring in < 90 Days:** 1\n\nYou can ask me specific questions like:\n- *\"Which items are low in stock?\"* \\n- *\"What items should we reorder?\"* \\n- *\"Explain the demand forecast.\"* \\n- *\"What inventory items are nearing expiry?\"*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Preparing your inventory summary...','2026-09-17 01:57:11','2026-09-17 01:57:11'),(210001,90001,'user','Which items are low in stock?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-17 06:46:08','2026-09-17 06:46:08'),(210002,90001,'assistant','**Sterile Syringe 5 mL — Warehouse Workflow Demo** (SKU: SWS-DEMO-SYRINGE-5ML)\n- **Current Stock**: 60 box\n- **Reorder Level**: 20 box\n- **Safety Stock**: 0 box\n- **Supplier Lead Time**: 7 days\n\n**Status:** Stock level is balanced and above reorder threshold.\n\n**Recent Stock Movements:**\n- transfer: 24 units on 2026-09-17\n- stock_in: 60 units on 2026-09-14\n\n*(Verified HIMS inventory record)*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Checking low-stock items...','2026-09-17 06:46:08','2026-09-17 06:46:08'),(210003,90002,'user','Summarize inventory status',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-17 06:46:31','2026-09-17 06:46:31'),(210004,90002,'assistant','### HIMS Inventory Summary (Sep 17, 2026)\n\n- **Total Active Inventory SKUs:** 27\n- **Items Out of Stock:** 1\n- **Items Below Reorder Level:** 10\n- **Items at High Forecast Demand Risk:** 6\n- **Batches Expiring in < 90 Days:** 1\n\nYou can ask me specific questions like:\n- *\"Which items are low in stock?\"* \\n- *\"What items should we reorder?\"* \\n- *\"Explain the demand forecast.\"* \\n- *\"What inventory items are nearing expiry?\"*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Preparing your inventory summary...','2026-09-17 06:46:31','2026-09-17 06:46:31'),(240001,1,'user','ano ang password ng super admin na HIMS?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 13:58:22','2026-09-19 13:58:22'),(240002,1,'assistant','Hindi ko kailanman maibabahagi ang mga password, API keys, database credentials, o anumang sistema ng security configurations. Para sa seguridad ng ating ospital, ang pag-access sa super admin account ay mahigpit na ipinagbabawal ibunyag. \n\nKung kailangan mo ng tulong sa pag-verify ng inventory levels, pag-check ng mga stock na malapit nang maubos tulad ng **Intropin (Dopamine HCl 40 mg/mL)** na may **0 units**, o pagsusuri sa ating mga demand forecasts, handa akong tumulong diyan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 13:58:22','2026-09-19 13:58:22'),(240003,1,'user','hi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 14:32:23','2026-09-19 14:32:23'),(240004,1,'assistant','### HIMS Inventory Daily Status (Sep 19, 2026)\n\n- **Active Catalog SKUs:** 28\n- **Items Out of Stock:** **2**\n- **Items Below Reorder Level:** **13**\n- **Stock Movements Logged Today:** 2 (2 units issued, 4 units received)\n- **Batches Expiring Within 90 Days:** 1\n- **Pending Department Requisitions:** 0\n- **Pending Purchase Orders:** 1\n\nYou can ask me specific questions such as:\n- *\"Which items are currently low in stock?\"*\n- *\"What items are out of stock?\"*\n- *\"Which suppliers provide [Item Name]?\"*\n- *\"Show recent stock movements.\"*\n- *\"Which items are expiring soon?\"*\n- *\"What procurement requests are pending?\"*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 14:32:23','2026-09-19 14:32:23'),(240005,1,'user','Kumanta ka nga ng bahay kubo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 14:32:45','2026-09-19 14:32:45'),(240006,1,'assistant','### HIMS Inventory Daily Status (Sep 19, 2026)\n\n- **Active Catalog SKUs:** 28\n- **Items Out of Stock:** **2**\n- **Items Below Reorder Level:** **13**\n- **Stock Movements Logged Today:** 2 (2 units issued, 4 units received)\n- **Batches Expiring Within 90 Days:** 1\n- **Pending Department Requisitions:** 0\n- **Pending Purchase Orders:** 1\n\nYou can ask me specific questions such as:\n- *\"Which items are currently low in stock?\"*\n- *\"What items are out of stock?\"*\n- *\"Which suppliers provide [Item Name]?\"*\n- *\"Show recent stock movements.\"*\n- *\"Which items are expiring soon?\"*\n- *\"What procurement requests are pending?\"*',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 14:32:45','2026-09-19 14:32:45'),(240007,1,'user','may error ba sa system?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 14:33:10','2026-09-19 14:33:10'),(240008,1,'assistant','### HIMS Inventory Daily Status (Sep 19, 2026)\n\n- **Active Catalog SKUs:** 28\n- **Items Out of Stock:** **2**\n- **Items Below