ULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 15:46:29','2026-09-19 15:46:29'),(300006,120001,'assistant','That is outside what I can help with. I answer questions about HIMS inventory and hospital supply operations — stock levels, reordering, expiring batches, suppliers, purchase orders, requisitions, deliveries, and system status.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 15:46:29','2026-09-19 15:46:29'),(300007,120001,'user','ano yung mga FIFO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 15:46:44','2026-09-19 15:46:44'),(300008,120001,'assistant','That is outside what I can help with. I answer questions about HIMS inventory and hospital supply operations — stock levels, reordering, expiring batches, suppliers, purchase orders, requisitions, deliveries, and system status.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 15:46:44','2026-09-19 15:46:44'),(300009,120001,'user','ano yung mga puwede kong itanong?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 15:47:00','2026-09-19 15:47:00'),(300010,120001,'assistant','That is outside what I can help with. I answer questions about HIMS inventory and hospital supply operations — stock levels, reordering, expiring batches, suppliers, purchase orders, requisitions, deliveries, and system status.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 15:47:00','2026-09-19 15:47:00'),(330001,120001,'user','hi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 16:02:23','2026-09-19 16:02:23'),(330002,120001,'assistant','Hello! I\'m the HIMS inventory assistant. I can tell you which items are low or out of stock, what needs reordering, which batches are nearing expiry, and what is happening with suppliers, purchase orders, requisitions, and deliveries. What would you like to check?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Looking into that...','2026-09-19 16:02:23','2026-09-19 16:02:23'),(330003,120001,'user','ano yung mga puwede kong itanong?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-19 16:02:30','2026-09-19 16:02:30'),(330004,120001,'assistant','### What I can answer\n\nI cover HIMS hospital supply and inventory operations — in English, Filipino, or Taglish, in whatever wording is natural. You are signed in as **Super Administrator**, and this is what you can ask me:\n\n**Stock levels and items**\n- Which items are low on stock, and which are completely out of stock\n- What needs reordering, with the quantity HIMS has already calculated for it\n- A specific item by name or SKU — physical, reserved, and available stock, batches, and lead time\n\n**Expiry and batches**\n- Batches nearing expiry, over the window you name — this month, 30, 60, or 90 days\n- Batches that have already expired\n- Items with no expiry date recorded\n\n**Suppliers and procurement**\n- Which supplier supplies an item, with contact details and lead time\n- Purchase orders and their status\n- Department requisitions and supply requests\n- Deliveries and shipments, including the ones running late\n- Unit costs and the total value of inventory on hand\n\n**Forecasts and the system**\n- Demand forecasts, days of cover, and projected consumption\n- Anything needing attention now — reordering, expiry, and delivery exceptions\n- A daily inventory summary or status report\n- Stock movements and adjustments — what changed, when, and who recorded it\n- What a HIMS term means — FEFO, reorder level, safety stock, days of cover, and the rest of the glossary\n- Recent audit activity — who changed a record, and when\n- System recovery status and open failures\n\n**Ask me things like:** \"Ano yung mga paubos na?\", \"May expired stock ba?\", \"Sino supplier ng Paracetamol?\", \"Anong items ang mag-e-expire this month?\", \"Ano ang FEFO?\"\n\nAnything outside hospital supply operations — general knowledge, arithmetic, writing — is not something I answer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Listing what 