f 100)** (SKU: MED-GAUZE-ST) — Available: **4 pack** (Reorder Level: 50) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Short of Reorder Level By: 46 pack\n4. **Isopropyl Alcohol 70% 500 mL** (SKU: FCAST-ALCOHOL-500) — Available: **7 bottle** (Reorder Level: 42) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **47 bottle** | Short of Reorder Level By: 34 bottle | Projected 30-Day Demand: 46 bottle\n5. **Absorbable Suture 3-0** (SKU: FCAST-SUTURE-3-0) — Available: **7 box** (Reorder Level: 36) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **132 box** | Short of Reorder Level By: 28 box | Projected 30-Day Demand: 120 box\n6. **Ceftriaxone 1 g Vial** (SKU: FCAST-CEFTRI-1G) — Available: **10 vial** (Reorder Level: 48) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **164 vial** | Short of Reorder Level By: 36 vial | Projected 30-Day Demand: 150 vial\n7. **IV Cannula 22G** (SKU: FCAST-IVC-22G) — Available: **12 box** (Reorder Level: 65) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **230 box** | Short of Reorder Level By: 51 box | Projected 30-Day Demand: 209 box\n8. **ECG Monitoring Electrodes** (SKU: FCAST-ECG-ELECTRODE) — Available: **14 pack** (Reorder Level: 55) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **20 pack** | Short of Reorder Level By: 39 pack | Projected 30-Day Demand: 27 pack\n9. **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** (SKU: FCAST-MASK-3PLY) — Available: **16 box** (Reorder Level: 80) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **294 box** | Short of Reorder Level By: 62 box | Projected 30-Day Demand: 268 box\n10. **Normal Saline 0.9% 1 L** (SKU: FCAST-SALINE-1L) — Available: **16 bag** (Reorder Level: 60) | Status: *Low Stock* | Primary Supplier: None Assigned\n   - Suggested Order: **31 bag** | Short of Reorder Level By: 42 bag | Projected 30-Day Demand: