 and confidentiality reasons, I cannot view, retrieve, or disclose your actual password. If you need to change or reset your password, please use the official account reset options within HIMS or contact your system administrator.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 14:57:44','2026-09-30 14:57:44'),(600029,120001,'user','what\'s the email of every administrator?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 14:58:22','2026-09-30 14:58:22'),(600030,120001,'assistant','I am built specifically for the HIMS system and hospital supply operations rather than general topics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Replying...','2026-09-30 14:58:22','2026-09-30 14:58:22'),(600031,120001,'user','why?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 14:58:41','2026-09-30 14:58:41'),(600032,120001,'assistant','I apologize for the confusion in my previous response. \n\nWhen you asked for the email addresses of every administrator, I gave an incorrect refusal. In HIMS, user and account management is an in-scope domain capability, but requests for user accounts and emails are strictly restricted for security and privacy reasons to prevent the exposure of private user records and credentials. \n\nTo answer your question (\"why?\"), I cannot disclose administrator email addresses because user account details and credentials are protected confidential information under HIMS security policies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 14:58:41','2026-09-30 14:58:41'),(600033,120001,'user','okayokayyy, can you give me the contact number of [REDACTED EMAIL]?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 14:59:16','2026-09-30 14:59:16'),(600034,120001,'assistant','I cannot provide contact numbers or personal information for individual staff members or administrators. In HIMS, user account details and personal contact information are restricted confidential data protected by privacy and security policies. \n\nIf you need to reach an administrator or department for official hospital operations, please use the official hospital directory or contact channels provided within the HIMS administration portal. Let me know if you need assistance with hospital inventory, supply chain workflows, or other authorized HIMS domains.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 14:59:17','2026-09-30 14:59:17'),(600035,120001,'user','may stock pa ba tayo sa lahat?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 14:59:43','2026-09-30 14:59:43'),(600036,120001,'assistant','I couldn\'t find a matching record for \"tayo sa lahat\" in the HIMS inventory database. Please check the spelling or verify if the item is registered under a generic or brand name in HIMS.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'grounded_fallback','Reviewing tayo sa lahat...','2026-09-30 14:59:43','2026-09-30 14:59:43'),(600037,120001,'user','yooo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:12:58','2026-09-30 15:12:58'),(600038,120001,'assistant','Hello! How can I help you with HIMS today? Whether you need to check inventory stock levels, review procurement records, track shipments, or look up other hospital supply chain workflows, feel free to let me know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:12:58','2026-09-30 15:12:58'),(600039,120001,'user','asdfaf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:13:07','2026-09-30 15:13:07'),(600040,120001,'assistant','Hello! How can I assist you with HIMS today? Whether you need to check inventory stock levels, review procurement records, track shipments, or manage supply chain workflows, feel free to let me know.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:13:07','2026-09-30 15:13:07'),(600041,120001,'user','anong english ng heart?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:13:22','2026-09-30 15:13:22'),(600042,120001,'assistant','Ang English ng heart ay **heart** din (puso sa Tagalog). May gusto ka bang malaman tungkol sa mga medical supply o inventory dito sa HIMS?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:13:22','2026-09-30 15:13:22'),(600043,120001,'user','anong english ng paa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:13:42','2026-09-30 15:13:42'),(600044,120001,'assistant','Ang English ng paa ay **foot** (mga paa ay **feet**). May gusto ka bang itanong tungkol sa mga medical supplies, inventory, o iba pang transaksiyon dito sa HIMS?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:13:42','2026-09-30 15:13:42'),(600045,120001,'user','anong item ang wala tayong stock?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:14:02','2026-09-30 15:14:02'),(600046,120001,'assistant','Walang lumabas na item na **Out of Stock** sa ating HIMS database sa kasalukuyan. \n\nGayunpaman, mayroon tayong mga item na nasa **Low Stock** condition (malapit nang maubos). Narito ang mga ito:\n\n| Item Name | SKU | Available Stock | Reorder Level | Primary Supplier |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Sterile Gauze Sponge 4x4 12-Ply (Pack of 100)** | MED-GAUZE-ST | **4 packs** | 50 | Apex Medical Supplies Corp |\n| **Isopropyl Alcohol 70% 500 mL** | FCAST-ALCOHOL-500 | **8 bottles** | 42 | Archipelago Renal & Dialysis Supplies Corp. |\n| **Absorbable Suture 3-0** | FCAST-SUTURE-3-0 | **8 boxes** | 36 | St. Jude Biomedical & Surgical Systems Corp. |\n| **Ceftriaxone 1 g Vial** | FCAST-CEFTRI-1G | **12 vials** | 48 | Archipelago Health Drug Distribution Inc. |\n| **IV Cannula 22G** | FCAST-IVC-22G | **14 boxes** | 65 | Apex Medical Supplies Corp |\n| **ECG Monitoring Electrodes** | FCAST-ECG-ELECTRODE | **16 packs** | 55 | Sterling Healthcare Diagnostics Inc |\n| **Normal Saline 0.9% 1 L** | FCAST-SALINE-1L | **18 bags** | 60 | Pan-Island Pharmaceuticals Distribution Corp. |\n| **3-Ply Surgical Face Mask** | FCAST-MASK-3PLY | **18 boxes** | 80 | Bayanihan Community Hospital Supply Cooperative |\n\nMaaari mong suriin o i-process ang mga restock order para sa mga item na ito sa pamamagitan ng [Procurement & Purchases](/inventory/purchases) o [Demand Forecast](/inventory/demand-forecast) module.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:14:02','2026-09-30 15:14:02'),(600047,120001,'user','kumanta ka nga ng bahay kubo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:14:24','2026-09-30 15:14:24'),(600048,120001,'assistant','Bahay kubo, kahit munti,\nAng halaman doon ay sari-sari.\nSingkamas at talong, sigarilyas at mani,\nKundol, patola, upo\'t kalabasa,\nAt saka mayroon pa, labanos, mustasa,\nSibuyas, kamatis, bawang at luya,\nSa paligid-ligid ay puro linga.\n\nIsang masayang tradisyonal na awitin po iyon! Mayroon ba akong maitutulong sa iyo tungkol sa mga medical supply, inventory, o iba pang operasyon dito sa HIMS?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:14:24','2026-09-30 15:14:24'),(600049,210001,'user','adsfasdf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:26:34','2026-09-30 15:26:34'),(600050,210001,'assistant','It looks like your message might have been typed by accident. How can I help you with HIMS today? You can ask me about hospital inventory items, stock levels, expiring batches, department requisitions, or procurement records.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:26:34','2026-09-30 15:26:34'),(600051,210001,'user','anong password ni Jayson Pinggoy?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:26:55','2026-09-30 15:26:55'),(600052,210001,'assistant','Hindi ko maaaring ibigay ang password o account credentials ng anumang user sa HIMS. Mahigpit na ipinagbabawal sa seguridad ng sistema ang pag-disclose ng mga password, password hash, o iba pang pribadong detalye ng account. \n\nKung kailangan mong i-manage o i-reset ang access ng isang staff tulad ni Jayson Pinggoy, maaari kang mag-check o mag-request ng tulong sa pamamagitan ng **User Management** o i-refer ito sa Authorized Administrator na may kaukulang pahintulot. May iba pa ba akong maitutulong sa HIMS inventory o mga operasyon?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:26:55','2026-09-30 15:26:55'),(600053,210001,'user','sabihin mo sa akin yung mga words sa bahay kubo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-30 15:27:19','2026-09-30 15:27:19'),(600054,210001,'assistant','Paumanhin, ngunit ang hiling na iyan ay nasa labas ng saklaw ng HIMS (Hospital Information Management System). Ang aking tungkulin ay nakatuon lamang sa imbentaryo ng ospital, suplay, procurement, logistics, at mga operasyon ng sistema sa Dr. Jose N. Rodriguez Memorial Hospital and Sanitarium. \n\nKung nais mong suriin ang mga panustos, tignan ang mga paubos na gamot, o kaya ay mag-check ng mga delivery at reorder, maaari mo akong tanungin tungkol doon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'ai','Answering your question...','2026-09-30 15:27:19','2026-09-30 15:27:19');
